#' Example local ancestry correlation: K = 6
#'
#' Data frame containing local ancestry correlation at pairs of
#' loci separated by various distances apart, for an admixed
#' population with 6 ancestral populations, 10 generations since
#' admixture, and admixture proportions contained in example_props_K6.
