#' not occur.
#'
#' @format Data frame has 3 columns named theta, corr, and anc.
#' \describe{
#'    \item{theta} recombination fraction between loci
#'    \item{corr} correlation in local ancestry at the loci
#'    \item{anc} which ancestral components are being compared (e.g., '1_1', '2_3')
#' }
#' Number of rows does not matter.
#'
#' @source Code to generate data available in data-raw.
#' @name example_corr_K6
